# Cargo build output. This matters more than usual here: `omarchy plugin
# add` clones the whole repo into ~/.config/omarchy/plugins/, and the
# shell hot-reloads plugin code whenever any file under that directory
# changes — a target/ dir there would trigger a reload storm on every
# build. Build from a separate clone, never from the installed copy.
/target
**/*.rs.bk

node_modules/
*.log
